    "sections": {
        "description": "Property Luxe Lite is the perfect free WordPress theme for your next real estate website. Designed for agencies, brokers, property consultants, rental businesses, and independent realtors, it helps you showcase homes, apartments, villas, and commercial listings with a clean, conversion-focused layout. Enjoy a customizable homepage hero, Featured Properties cards, header phone/email and social links, flexible page layouts, footer widgets, and WooCommerce support — all managed from the WordPress Customizer with live preview. Fully responsive, translation-ready, and built with lightweight code for solid performance. Looking for a free real estate WordPress theme? Property Luxe Lite is ready for your next project."
    },
